Given an array of integers, every element appears exactly twice except for one element, which appears only once.

Your task is to find and print that unique element.

Input Format

First line contains an integer N (size of the array) Second line contains N space-separated integers

Constraints

1 ≤ N ≤ 1000 All elements appear twice except one N is always odd.

Output Format

Print the element that appears only once
Sample Input 0

7
2 3 5 4 5 3 4
Sample Output 0

2
Sample Input 1

1
99
Sample Output 1

99
